  "currentRoundInspection": {
    "inspectedOn": "2026-10-15",
    "scope": "Two actually inspected Commons2011 front and2016 elevated side/roof pictures plus standard viewer PMTiles/DEM. No bespoke plans/surveys or picture redistribution. Hidden architecture/current finish and all heights remain approximate.",
    "pictures": [
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fa%C3%A7ana_de_la_catedral_de_Dubrovnik.JPG",
        "author": "Joanbanjo",
        "date": "2011-04-06",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-3.0",
        "observed": "Actually inspected front close view. Pale weathered coursed limestone Baroque facade, four free-standing central Corinthian columns with strong entablature, central rectangular dark wood portal/triangular pediment and two lower side doors under curved/broken segmental pediments. Outer figure niches have triangular heads. Upper central rectangular glazing above a shallow balcony, paired pilasters, triangular crown and flanking volute scrolls. Open balustrade shoulders with simplified statues. Background dark-gray ribbed dome/pale windowed lantern/cross. Ground threshold and fine sculpture not resolved."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dubrovnik_2016-05-26_DSC06252_view_from_the_wall_-_cropped.jpg",
        "author": "Ponor",
        "date": "2016-05-26",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
        "observed": "Actually inspected elevated northward-city-wall view looking toward cathedral and sea. Cathedral is center/back with dark gray ribbed dome on a pale round windowed drum, tall narrow pale lantern/cross. Nave, lower aisle lean-to roofs and large transverse arm roofs are gray metal, not the surrounding orange tile roofs. Long side elevation has approximately five upper arched rectangular windows/pilasters, lower semicircular lunettes and door/stair approach. Large transept end has broad semicircular glazed head under gray pediment. Bell tower on left and domed St Blaise in foreground/right are separate buildings and must not be included in cathedral model. Current finish and hidden rear/door detail remain approximate."
      }
    ]
  }
